OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a
OL,6,Fburst of blustery showers it will
OL,7,Fbecome dry with clear spells during
OL,8,Fthe evening, but winds will continue
OL,9,Fto strengthen to bring widespread
OL,10,Fgales inland overnight. Heavy showers
OL,11,Fwill return in the north during the
OL,12,Fearly hours.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with bright or
OL,15,Fsunny spells, but very strong and
OL,16,Fpotentially disruptive winds will
OL,17,Fcontinue throughout the day. Scattered
OL,18,Fshowers in the north at first, then
OL,19,Fmore widely later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
